<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs firm/$0.50 up - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs firm/$0.50 up - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were firm-$0.50 higher. Demand was moderate to good on a moderate movement. Top $58.75 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>				Country			     Plant</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 LBS. 56.50-57.50 Few 56.00 &amp; 58.00  57.00-58.75 US 2-3  230-260 LBS.  51.50-55.50</p>
<p>	  210-230 LBS.  46.50-51.50</p>
<p>Sows:  Steady to Firm, some 0.50 Higher. Top 49.00. US 1-3  300-500 LBS.  42.00-45.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 LBS.  45.00-47.50</p>
<p>Few over 600 LBS.  47.50-49.00</p>
</text>
